sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist<br/>(Notebook / Script)
    participant SDK as codeflare-sdk<br/>(Python Client)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Ray as Ray Cluster Dashboard<br/>8265/TCP HTTP(S)

    Note over User,Ray: Authentication Flow (one of three methods)

    alt TokenAuthentication
        User->>SDK: TokenAuthentication(token, server)<br/>+ optional CA cert path
        SDK->>SDK: Resolve TLS CA cert<br/>(explicit path / CF_SDK_CA_CERT_PATH /<br/>/etc/pki/tls/custom-certs/ca-bundle.crt)
        SDK->>K8sAPI: Authenticate with Bearer Token<br/>Authorization: Bearer <token>
        K8sAPI-->>SDK: Authentication OK
    else KubeConfigFileAuthentication
        User->>SDK: KubeConfigFileAuthentication(kube_config_path)
        SDK->>SDK: Load kubeconfig file
        SDK->>K8sAPI: Authenticate via kubeconfig credentials
        K8sAPI-->>SDK: Authentication OK
    else Auto-Detection (config_check)
        User->>SDK: config_check()
        SDK->>SDK: Try ~/.kube/config<br/>then in-cluster config
        SDK->>K8sAPI: Authenticate with detected credentials
        K8sAPI-->>SDK: Authentication OK
    end

    Note over User,Ray: Job Submission Flow

    User->>SDK: RayJobClient(address, ...)<br/>verify=True, headers, cookies
    SDK->>Ray: Connect to dashboard endpoint
    Ray-->>SDK: Connection established

    User->>SDK: submit_job(entrypoint, ...)
    SDK->>Ray: POST job submission<br/>entrypoint + runtime_env
    Ray-->>SDK: job_id

    User->>SDK: get_job_status(job_id)
    SDK->>Ray: GET job status
    Ray-->>SDK: JobStatus (PENDING/RUNNING/SUCCEEDED/FAILED)

    User->>SDK: get_job_logs(job_id)
    SDK->>Ray: GET job logs
    Ray-->>SDK: Log output

    opt Tail Logs
        User->>SDK: tail_job_logs(job_id)
        SDK->>Ray: Stream job logs
        Ray-->>SDK: Streaming log output
    end

    opt Stop / Delete Job
        User->>SDK: stop_job(job_id) / delete_job(job_id)
        SDK->>Ray: POST stop/DELETE job
        Ray-->>SDK: Confirmation
    end
